('B', '**Bulimia nervosa:** recurrent binge eating (a large amount with loss of control) and recurrent compensatory behavior (vomiting, laxatives, fasting, excessive exercise), both at least weekly for 3 months, with self-evaluation unduly shaped by weight and shape, at normal or higher weight.'),
