('P', '**CBT for eating disorders: how it is used.** The core problem is an over-evaluation of shape, weight, and their control, which drives strict dieting; dieting sets up binges, and binges lead to compensatory behaviors (Fairburn et al., 2003). Treatment therefore:'),
